  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy dialogues on productive water use in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to organize policy dialogues that will lead to a national strategy for a water-secure Jordan in 2050.The strategy report, resulting from the dialogues, provides a much-needed shared perspective to promote informed discussions (among donors, different Ministries, researchers, water use organizations, etc) in Jordan on how different water use sectors can work together towards a more water secure future by 2050.</narrative>
  </description>
